# Spirit of the Labyrinth: "If you draw a card, and then Spirit of the Labyrinth enters the battlefield, you won't be able
# to draw more cards that turn" (its ruling): the cards drawn this turn are counted from the turn's history, those drawn
# before it arrived included (CR 121.2b). Bot1 draws three with Ancestral Recall, then casts Spirit of the Labyrinth: Opt's
# draw is the turn's fourth card and can't happen, though its scry does.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Spirit of the Labyrinth
Ancestral Recall
Opt
Mox Ruby
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Ancestral Recall.Cast(Bot1)
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
? Bot1.Hand = Spirit of the Labyrinth; Opt; Island; Island; Island
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Spirit of the Labyrinth.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Opt.Cast
Bot1.Arrange(Island | )
[T1 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Hand = Island; Island; Island
Bot1.Library.Count = 17
Bot1.Graveyard = Opt; Ancestral Recall
